:: Carter Bedroom Play Sniff [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 20>>
You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> are playing a rousing game of superheroes, as you and your young friend want to do, when a sudden lull in the action causes <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> to snap up and quickly say <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I gotta run to the bathroom real quick. Sorry, I’ll be right back!”</span> <span style="color:Pink">You chuckle since, based on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s little desperate run and how he holds his groin, he has to go pretty bad, but didn’t want to stop the fun until the moment was right. He reminds you a lot of your younger brother, risking an accident for the sake of the continuing fun.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Eyes: "Tired",
            },	
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

You lie back on his bed, stretching your arms out and taking a moment to catch your breath. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> seems to be full of energy, so playing with him keeps you on your toes. You begin to glance around the room, it looking so strange in the silence and absence of your energetic friend. Then, for one reason or another, your gaze lands on his dresser. Specifically, the top drawer of his dresser, <span style="color:Pink">the universal spot for boys to put their socks and underwear.</span> <br>
<br>
You are alone in his room, with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> most likely at least taking a few minutes to empty his bladder. <span style="color:Pink">If you wanted to, there was nothing that would stop you…</span> <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
    <<link "Sniff his underwear<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        You stand up and slide over to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s dresser, gripping the top drawer with one hand before turning to the closed bedroom door. You are sure you’ll be alone for at least a minute, but quickly try to come up with some plausible reason why you’d be snooping in his drawers just in case. Maybe the handle fell off and you were just fixing it? Or maybe you heard a noise and were worried a rat had gotten into <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s secret candy stash he would clearly have stashed in his socks? <span style="color:LightGreen">Yeah, that sounds good!</span> <br>
        <br>
        You then pull out the drawer and are met with a barrage of colors that make up <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s underwear collection. <span style="color:Pink">It is exclusively briefs, all tiny, small, and colorful. He has a wide arrange of camo of all different colors, probably having come in a variety pack, along with an absurd amount of Ultraman briefs. Ones with the iconic U symbol in many different styles in colors, some taken from the various cartoons, the animated Ultraman plastered on the butt doing his heroic pose. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> has quite the collection of underwear, many you haven’t seen him wear before. <br>
        <br>
        While the patterns and prints were cute and what you normally saw <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> in, he seemed to also have a collection of solid color briefs, mainly blues and reds, that were shoved in the back. Finally, shoved in the back after being buried by his more colorful pairs, you find the crown jewel of any young boy’s underwear collection, tighty whities. You are surprised to find them in <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s stash, though figure they were probably bought for him by some family member or relative and shoved to the back after being deemed ‘too boring’ for the heroic boy. Still, you can’t help but take a minute to imagine the boy wearing them. They look so tiny and cute in your hands and would probably be snug even on his little body.</span> <br>
        <br>
        While there is a collection of other things in <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s underwear drawer, from random things he’s collected over the years to a small plastic container, you figure you only have a short amount of time left, <span style="color:Pink">so grab a pair you’ve seen him wear a bunch before and quickly press the crotch up to your face.</span> <br>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                    Name: "Player",
                    State: {
                        Mouth: "Happy",
                        Eyes: "Closed",
                        Blush: 3,
                    },	
                },
            ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>
        
        <span style="color:Pink">His underwear is well-washed, smelling of the ocean with a hint of laundry detergent, but there is a musk underneath that lingers. Sweat, a hint of maple, along with a fruity soap mixture. It smells exactly like <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>, the scent no doubt permanently soaked into the cotton after so many hours spent pressed up against <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s crotch. You imagine his tiny wiener pressed right up against where your nose is, jiggling about as he runs and plays. The thought is enticing as you feel your face flushing as you take in another long, deep breath.</span> <br>
        <br>
        Then you hear the sound of the bathroom door and hastily shove the underwear back into the drawer, slam it shut, and leap onto the bed, crashing down right as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> opens the door. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Sorry about that. Now, where were-?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> pauses, giving you a strange look, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“You alright? Your face is all red and sweaty. Is it hot in here? Come on, let’s get you some water!”</span> <span style="color:Pink"><span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> worriedly grabs you by the hand and leads you to the kitchen, instantly going into a mode that reminds you of Your Father when Noah shows signs of illness.</span> <br>
        <br>
        It’s kind of cute how the worry doesn’t seem to leave his face until your red cheeks disappear and you assure him you are fine. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oh, good.”</span> He sighs in relief, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Maybe we can play a less physical game for a bit. I wouldn’t want you to get tired out trying to keep up.”</span> He laughs, probably thinking his action-packed pretend adventures just wore you out. <br>

        <<set _arousalbs to []>>
        <<set _arousalkink to ["Preteens"]>>
        <<arousalGain 10 _arousalbs _arousalkink>>
        <span style="color:Green">+Carter Fun</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 10>>
        <span style="color:red">-Carter Energy</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Energy -= 5>>
        <<needChange "Fun" 10>>
        <<socialChange "Carter" 1>>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Carter House Carter Bedroom]]

    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
    <<link "Just wait<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        Whether you don’t want to invade <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s boundaries, yet aren’t in the mood, or you, for whatever reason, aren’t interested in sniffing your young friend’s underwear, you decide to just sit back and relax as you wait for <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> to return. That is the normal thing to do, after all, and the fact that would even cross some people’s minds when alone in his bedroom is a strange one. <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> returns a few minutes later, looking pretty relieved before jumping right back into it. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Alright! Where were we? Oh yeah! We gotta plan our attack on the villain base! I had an idea while I was-”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">The rest of the game goes well, with you both having fun in the daring, heroic adventures <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> makes up in his mind.</span> <br>

        <span style="color:Green">+Carter Fun</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 10>>
        <<needChange "Fun" 10>>
        <span style="color:red">-Carter Energy</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Energy -= 5>>
        <<socialChange "Carter" 1>>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Carter House Carter Bedroom]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
</div>